{"id":"649427","name":"黑全麦发糕","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/649427/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑全麦粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"4粒"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"2g"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黑全麦粉。","img":"images/649427/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛奶、红枣。","img":"images/649427/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红枣切粒。","img":"images/649427/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黑全麦粉内放入鸡蛋、酵母粉、糖。","img":"images/649427/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入牛奶。","img":"images/649427/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌至无干粉。","img":"images/649427/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入红枣粒，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/649427/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"常温发酵一个小时。","img":"images/649427/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"发酵好了。","img":"images/649427/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌排气。","img":"images/649427/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"准备几个小纸杯。","img":"images/649427/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"把面糊分入小杯。","img":"images/649427/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"二次发酵20分钟，表面撒点芝麻，大火蒸15分钟即可。","img":"images/649427/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"时间到，焖3分钟再开盖。","img":"images/649427/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蓬松宣软，越嚼越香。","img":"images/649427/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/649427/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}